    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**DNG 3D VIRTUAL TOUR OF THIS PROPERTY AVAILABLE**\n\nSuperbly located, and exceptionally well maintained 1930's property at 20 Ramleh Park retains many of the original features of this time, including cornicing, architraves, and skirting. The ever-popular Ramleh Park is a short walk to local shops at Milltown, and Ranelagh & Donnybrook are also in close proximity. Milltown Luas stop is only a short distance away. \n\nThis bright family accommodation includes tiled porch to hall door leading to the kitchen, lounge with bay window & dining room which interconnect via double doors. Upstairs there are three bedrooms & separate bathroom & w.c. with overall floor area of circa 89.38sq.m. 962 sq. ft. \n\nOutside, to the front there is a cobble locked pathway & railed mature garden, with side entrance to rear. \n\nTo the rear, there is a private sunny rear garden with Sandstone paving and lawn with rear pedestrian access. There is also a workshop, utility room and there are a number of additional storage sheds. \n\nThis is a quiet residential area with a wealth of educational, recreational, and local shopping amenities nearby. Some of Dublin's most highly regarded schools are within easy reach including Gonzaga College, Alexandra College, Sandford Park, St Michael's & Muckross Park College. David Lloyd Riverview, UCD Belfield Campus and Milltown & Elm Park Golf Clubs are all within a short distance, with the RDS, Aviva & Herbert Park also in walking distance. The City Centre is circa 4.0km (2.45 miles) and the villages of Ranelagh, Donnybrook are nearby with a selection of amenities, including boutique shops, restaurant's & bars. There are a number of shopping centres also convenient, including: Dundrum Town Centre, via the Luas, The Swan Centre Rathmines, Merrion, Stillorgan and Blackrock. Within walking distance also are sporting venues, RDS & Aviva Stadium & The pleasant walkways along river Dodder are close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.79m x 4.68m\nUnderstairs storage\n\nLounge - 3.62m x 4.61m\nWith bay window, tiled fireplace and double doors leading to....\n\nDining Room - 3.35m x 3.68m\nWith tiled fireplace\n\nKitchen - 2.05m x 2.52m\nSelection of fitted presses, & counter, tiled floor, cooker, hob, extractor & dishwasher, understairs storage\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.25m x 4..58m\nBay window and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.25m x 3.72m\nWith built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.17m x 2.84m\nWith built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 1.43m x 2.40m\nWith tiles walls, hot-press, Triton shower & w.h.b and separate w.c. tiled"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Original Architraves, Skirting, Picture Rails & Cornicing</li><li> Light Fittings & Downlighters</li><li> Cobble locked Pathway to Front Tiled Porch</li><li> Side Entrance</li><li> Rear Gate with Pedestrian Access</li><li> Burglar Alarm</li><li> Workshop 3.5m x 2.57m</li><li> Store 1. 2.82m x 1.53m</li><li> Utility Room with fitted units 3.89 x 1.79m</li><li> Including fridge/freezer, freezer, washing machine & dryer</li><li> Garden Sheds x 2</li><li> Outside Tap & Lighting</li><li> Telephone and Cable T.V. available.</li><li> Carpets, Drapes & Blinds</li><li> Mature Private Sunny Patio & Garden with Sandstone Paving</li><li> Floor Area 89.38sq.m. 962sq.ft.)</li></ul>"
